$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=z5dqrset  LOC_AFTER=?

* The structural key of the Q_R block (Lean coprime_qR_iff, hRsetq): an integer k <_ R is coprime to q_R exactly when it is coprime to N, since its prime factors are <_ R; so RSet is the same at the moduli q_R and N.

